   - If necessary, create a controlled test environment where minimal user and item data is populated in the respective text files. This ensures that data loading works correctly without relying on a potentially corrupted or malformed file.

By addressing these issues with the proposed guidance, future development should lead to fewer startup errors and facilitate smoother unit test executions. 

